{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 69,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "69:1",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "The Inevitable Reality -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:2",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "What is the Inevitable Reality?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:3",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And what can make you know what is the Inevitable Reality?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:4",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "Thamūd and ʿAad denied the Striking Calamity [i.e., the Resurrection].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:5",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "So as for Thamūd, they were destroyed by the overpowering [blast].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:6",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "And as for ʿAad, they were destroyed by a screaming, violent wind",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:7",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "Which He [i.e., Allāh] imposed upon them for seven nights and eight days in succession, so you would see the people therein fallen as if they were hollow trunks of palm trees.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:8",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "Then do you see of them any remains?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:9",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "And there came Pharaoh and those before him and the overturned cities with sin.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:10",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "And they disobeyed the messenger of their Lord, so He seized them with a seizure exceeding [in severity].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:11",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "Indeed, when the water overflowed, We carried you [i.e., your ancestors] in the sailing ship",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:12",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "That We might make it for you a reminder and [that] a conscious ear would be conscious of it.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:13",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "Then when the Horn is blown with one blast",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:14",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "And the earth and the mountains are lifted and leveled with one blow [i.e., stroke] -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:15",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "Then on that Day, the Occurrence [i.e., Resurrection] will occur,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:16",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "And the heaven will split [open], for that Day it is infirm.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:17",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "And the angels are at its edges. And there will bear the Throne of your Lord above them, that Day, eight [of them].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:18",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "That Day, you will be exhibited [for judgement]; not hidden among you is anything concealed.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:19",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "So as for he who is given his record in his right hand, he will say, \"Here, read my record!",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:20",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "Indeed, I was certain that I would be meeting my account.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:21",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "So he will be in a pleasant life -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:22",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "In an elevated garden,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:23",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "Its [fruit] to be picked hanging near.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:24",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "[They will be told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you put forth in the days past.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:25",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "But as for he who is given his record in his left hand, he will say, \"Oh, I wish I had not been given my record",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:26",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "And had not known what is my account.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:27",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "I wish it [i.e., my death] had been the decisive one.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:28",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "My wealth has not availed me.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:29",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "Gone from me is my authority.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:30",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "[Allāh will say], \"Seize him and shackle him.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:31",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "Then into Hellfire drive him.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:32",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "Then into a chain whose length is seventy cubits insert him.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:33",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "Indeed, he did not used to believe in Allāh, the Most Great,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:34",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "Nor did he encourage the feeding of the poor.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:35",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "So there is not for him here this Day any devoted friend",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:36",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "Nor any food except from the discharge of wounds;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:37",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "None will eat it except the sinners.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:38",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "So I swear by what you see",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:39",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "And what you do not see",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:40",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "[That] indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is the word of a noble Messenger.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:41",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 41,
      "text": "And it is not the word of a poet; little do you believe.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:42",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 42,
      "text": "Nor the word of a soothsayer; little do you remember.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:43",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 43,
      "text": "[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:44",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 44,
      "text": "And if he [i.e., Muḥammad] had made up about Us some [false] sayings,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:45",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 45,
      "text": "We would have seized him by the right hand;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:46",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 46,
      "text": "Then We would have cut from him the aorta.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:47",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 47,
      "text": "And there is no one of you who could prevent [Us] from him.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:48",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 48,
      "text": "And indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a reminder for the righteous.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:49",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 49,
      "text": "And indeed, We know that among you are deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:50",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 50,
      "text": "And indeed, it will be [a cause of] regret upon the disbelievers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:51",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 51,
      "text": "And indeed, it is the truth of certainty.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "69:52",
      "surahNumber": 69,
      "ayahNumber": 52,
      "text": "So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
